OL,3,GNEWSA'Four years after being paralysed,
OL,4,AI'm stuck in a prison cell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was left suddenly paralysed
OL,7,Ffour years ago is still searching for a
OL,8,Fsuitable place to live, saying the
OL,9,Fexperience had left him feeling like he
OL,10,Fis in "a prison cell".
OL,12,FJohn Bonsor said his symptoms started
OL,13,Fin October 2022 as just back pain, but
OL,14,Fwithin hours he was paralysed below the
OL,15,Fchest and would go on to be diagnosed
OL,16,Fwith a bleed on the spine.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
