OL,3,GNEWSA'Four years after being paralysed,
OL,4,AI'm stuck in a prison cell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 38-year-old, from Bedworth, was
OL,7,Fforced to sell his two-bedroom terraced
OL,8,Fhouse because it could not be adapted
OL,9,Ffor his wheelchair and he moved into a
OL,10,Fmakeshift bedroom in his father's
OL,11,Fconverted garage.
OL,13,FBut he cannot leave without help and
OL,14,Fthere is no bathroom he can use.
